# The arena world IS committed. `universe/*` used to blanket-exclude it, which
# silently beat the root .gitignore's intent -- ignore everything under
# universe/ except the world itself and the warp table. The players/ and
# memories* rules above still apply and are what keep player data out.
universe/*
!universe/worlds/
!universe/warps.json